                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I love zombie themed anything and was so hoping this game would work for me.\nIf you have a lot of patience and don't get frustrated easily then you might like this game.\n\nThe art is lovely, and the concept is awesome. \nIt's very pleasing to look at, however the game feels so incomplete.\n\nMy only issues were that the levels were unforgiving , spent too long trying to progress with a messy checkpoint system so I could see more of the game then gave up and uninstalled it. Not worth the frustration.\n\n\n\n",
